<h4 id="4-what-if-align-is-not-a-power-of-two">4. What If align Is Not a Power of Two?</h4>

<p>If <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">align</code> is not a power of two (e.g., <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">align = 100</code>), the traditional modulo operation must be used:</p>

<div class="language-swift highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><table class="rouge-table"><tbody><tr><td class="rouge-gutter gl"><pre class="lineno">1
2
3
